/-!
# Group-theoretic infrastructure

This assembly re-exports the project-wide finite-group, Sylow, Hall,
commutator, p-group, conjugation, and strong-embedding interfaces. The Sylow
normal-closure lemma records that a p-subgroup inside a normal subgroup is
generated by conjugates of its intersection with any fixed Sylow subgroup;
the full-commutator normalizer transfer packages the generic calculation used
in Stellmacher (5.2); and the elementary-core endpoint packages the reusable
small-group identification used by Stellmacher (8.2).
-/
